ind":"update","title":"Demo Patch 1.3.04","summary":"🔷Bugs🔷coyote time is now properly applyinginteracting with raccoon catapult doesn't break stealth and works properly nowthe first transition to raven at the bridge now works again and you can actually fly afterwards.transform to wolf tutorial shows correct buttons when playing with controller","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T10:18:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114035813","verified_at":"2026-10-23T11:23:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2249060-1847286114027857","game_id":"steam-2249060","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch 1.3.03","summary":"🔷Improvements🔷Introduced enemy push back feedback when hitting themThere is now also a smaller dodge when wolf form is not yet availableSome textures that may appeared blurry should now render properly🔷Bugs🔷aiming has now a correct cooldown phase, so you can't aim while aiming anymoregamma setting is now working properly","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T07:33:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114027857","verified_at":"2026-10-21T10:48:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2249060-1846018067942006","game_id":"steam-2249060","kind":"announcement","title":"Playing the new Demo with our Developer","summary":"Steam Next Fest is coming up in one week, so I went ahead and played through the Demo🔷Here is what you can expect🔷complete play-through of the demoshowcase of major features of the game like transforming, character customization and mechanicsbackground information to the Demoin depth explanations of systems and featuresrandom chit chat","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-12T18:41:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067942006","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2249060-1845383656385454","game_id":"steam-2249060","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch 1.3.01","summary":"🔷 Updates🔷Skilltree passives are available in Demo now: By spending shards in skilltrees, you can unlock form specific passive abilities!🔷 Fixes🔷Refunding Combos at the Raccoon Statue now works properlyArena quests now properly abort, when interaction with the other chaliceFixed some issues regarding spawning in the air or falling through the ground after loading into the game.Back Button works now properly in Memory Menu🔷 Improvements🔷Performance improvements for Low settings for projectiles wh","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-02T08:44:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656385454","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2249060-1844751498221531","game_id":"steam-2249060","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update 1.3.0","summary":"It's been a while since the last demo update, but a lot has happened in the meantime which means this one is quite a big one!❗Due to changes in the main structure of the game your current save games are not usable anymore - which means any progress of the demo is lost❗🔷 Updates🔷New extended flying area with space for a lot of explorationAdditional side questsArena area with two difficulties. This is actually a big one. You will find a few shards there as well so you have a bit more combos to cho","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-24T13:35:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498221531","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2249060-1819386365088979","game_id":"steam-2249060","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch 1.0.20","summary":"🔷 Updates🔷Save slot system: up to 3 save slots available!Remappable key bindings for both keyboard and controllerPassive Abilities for each form introduced - unlockable via skill trees🔷 Fixes 🔷Void wall at Blossom Refuge now disappears properly when reloading into the gameFixed an issue with disappearing tool-tips.Music is now playing the correct tunes when loading back into the gameZooming in and out is now possible when interacting with Alkina 🔷 Improvements, QoL🔷Transforming actions can now i","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-12-18T08:44:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1819386365088979","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2249060-1815034432977924","game_id":"steam-2249060","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch 1.0.10","summary":"🔷 Fixes 🔷Saving the correct amount of Peace-Orbs nowInteracting with the Portal doesn't get you stuck anymore when you have too little Peace-OrbsOpen tip now properly works with key \"H\"🔷 New Features: Combo Helper 🔷Introducing a combo helper, showing you combos while fighting.only shows combos you already have learnedhelps you deciding which combo you want to buildApologies for the Patch-Size, due to restructuring of folders on our side this patch got way bigger download size than anticipated.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-11-02T19:39:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1815034432977924","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2249060-1814309641450694","ga